#
# Security region: host, hardened
#
# What the machine takes from the media and the kernel it runs on. STRICT_HOST
# 2: a disk with this build that the session did not start from is asked
# about even on an internal bus (a disk whose script runs as root is the
# machine's to choose, not the first one the kernel lists), media announces
# nothing to the shell, kptr_restrict is 2, io_uring is refused to everybody,
# and ptrace attach needs CAP_SYS_PTRACE (Yama 2).
#
CONFIG_MOONWATER_STRICT_HOST=2
